    "body": "Hi! Thanks for your work btw!\r\n\r\nIt's a normal file.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n❯ which kak\r\n/usr/local/bin/kak\r\n\r\n❯ EDITOR=/usr/local/bin/kak starship config\r\nthread 'main' panicked at 'Unable to locate editor in $PATH.: Custom { kind: NotFound, error: CannotFindBinaryPath }', src/configure.rs:274:10\r\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\r\n\r\n❯ echo $PATH\r\n/home/charles-langlois/.nvm/versions/node/v16.13.2/bin:/home/charles-langlois/.cargo/bin:/home/charles-langlois/bin:/home/charles-langlois/.local/bin:/home/charles-langlois/go/bin:/usr/local/go/bin:/home/charles-langlois/.local/bin:/home/charles-langlois/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin:/usr/games:/usr/local/games:/snap/bin\r\n\r\n```\r\n",
